sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant G as Gateway
    participant A as Model A (first choice)
    participant B as Model B (next in the chain)
    Note over App,B: Request 1
    App->>G: generate()
    G->>A: ask
    A-->>G: 429 rate limit
    Note over G: bench A for 30 seconds
    G->>B: ask (fallback)
    B-->>G: answer
    G-->>App: answer, flagged "fallback used: A to B"
    Note over App,B: Request 2, ten seconds later
    App->>G: generate()
    Note over G: A is benched, so skip it
    G->>B: ask
    B-->>G: answer
    G-->>App: answer
